\p{The names of the rows of section 4 say what the reviewer expected ("then sure reject"); the table says what happened. The 56 rows of the first pass under the candidate, run again here and equal to the author's table on every row: 9 rejections of official accepts, all of them the trigger gaps of the first pass that the published build has too, and 7 accepts of official rejects, the published build's 7.}

\ul{
\li{\strong{Attacked without result.} A statement that is not derivable accepted through an unsure K reduction: none built, for the reason of section 2; the black-box corpus has 1,064 such inputs and none is accepted. The mark lost on a restart, in a speculative segment, through a memo inside the unit, on the cold retry: by reading, section 2. A later declaration rejected with confidence through what an unsure unit left: 19 exports, section 4. \code{kunion=off} against the base: 80 exports.}
\li{\strong{Not attacked.} An unsure unit that enters eager reduction after its K comparison (the restart, the deferred comparisons at the end of the unit, a mode-aware second run that rejects before it reaches the comparison): read, no export. The frame scan of section 7: no export. Other switch sets than the default. Whether the value of an applied let variable can be met by a later declaration under any configuration (section 4). The x86-64 architecture. The gates and the guard of section 13 were not repeated beyond what section 5 says.}
\li{\strong{An error of the reviewer.} The exports of this pass were first named with the prefix of the black-box review; they are \code{rv2a2-*} now, with the same content.}
}
}

\subtree{
\title{9. Verdict}

\p{\strong{No-go for variant A as built; go with the session ended after an accepted unit that the published machine would have declined, once that change has passed G1, its four controls and the files with several declarations of the black-box corpus.} For the rule: it is small, it adds no judgment, its two claims per unit rest on an argument of ten lines and not on a reconstruction of the official state, every real unit of the class is a verdict of the machine in the first run, and no accept of a statement that is not derivable was found by either review of either candidate. Against it as built: one wrong reject that the published plain run does not have (G1), by a cause that is the published build's and that any change from decline to accept will uncover; the claim that carries the candidate after the first one fell on wrong rejects of its own should be true as stated before the candidate is applied, and one line makes it so. The rows: G1 and its two accepting controls are proposed as strict rows (3), the two rebuilt known rejections and the control of finding MO2-F3 as rows with the mark of a known wrong reject (3), the 18 session probes as strict rows.}
}
